        question: "Place these nursing actions in correct priority order for a postpartum patient who develops sudden chest pain, dyspnea, SpO2 86%, and unilateral leg swelling 18 hours after vaginal delivery: 1) Administer prescribed unfractionated heparin IV bolus, 2) Apply high-flow oxygen via non-rebreather, 3) Notify the provider, 4) Position semi-Fowler's and obtain IV access. Which is the CORRECT sequence?",
